14:["$","ol","ol-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"拦截"}],"：你发出的 DNS 请求，还没出电脑网卡，就被 VPN 软件截获了。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"秒回"}],"：VPN",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"立刻、马上、随便"}],"编一个内网 IP（比如我看到的 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"172.19.0.13"}],"）扔给你的系统。\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["VPN 在心里记了个账：",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"172.19.0.13"}]," <==> ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"hedon.top"}],"。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"欺骗成功"}],"：浏览器（或 traceroute）拿到了这个 IP，以为是真的，于是向这个 IP 发起连接。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"偷梁换柱"}],"：数据包发出来，又被 VPN 截获。VPN 查账本，发现目标是 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"172.19.0.13"}],"，于是它知道：\"哦，这其实是要去访问 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"hedon.top"}],"\"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"远程解析"}],"：VPN 把\"访问 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"hedon.top"}],"\"这个指令发给远端的代理服务器，由远端服务器去解析真正的 IP 并传输数据。"]}],"\n"]}]
15:["$","$L40","pre-1,code-0",{"source":"sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    participant App as 浏览器/App\n    participant OS as 操作系统/DNS栈\n    participant Clash as Clash (Fake IP)\n    participant Remote as 远端代理服务器\n\n    Note over App, Clash: 阶段一：DNS 欺骗 (极速响应)\n\n    App->>OS: 域名解析请求: hedon.top\n    OS->>Clash: 发送 UDP 53 包\n\n    Note right of Clash: Clash 拦截请求<br>根本不去查互联网！\n    Clash->>Clash: 1. 从 Fake IP 池选一个空闲 IP<br>比如 172.19.0.13\n    Clash->>Clash: 2. 记账 (Mapping)<br>\"172.19.0.13\" = \"hedon.top\"\n\n    Clash-->>App: 秒回: IP 是 172.19.0.13\n\n    Note over App, Clash: 阶段二：建立连接 (偷梁换柱)\n\n    App->>App: 以为拿到了真 IP<br>向 172.19.0.13 发起 TCP 连接\n    App->>Clash: TCP SYN (Dst: 172.19.0.13)\n\n    Note right of Clash: Clash 拦截 TCP 包<br>查账本：172.19.0.13 是谁？\n    Clash->>Clash: 哦，原来是 hedon.top\n\n    Clash->>Remote: 把\"域名 hedon.top\"发给远端<br>由远端服务器去解析真实 IP\n    Remote->>Remote: 在海外解析并连接真实服务器"}]
16:["$","p","p-9",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"关键点："}]}]
17:["$","ol","ol-2",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"省时"}],"：DNS 响应是",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"毫秒级"}],"的，因为根本不需要网络请求，Clash 直接从内存里扔一个 IP 给你。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"防污染"}],"：因为本地根本不进行真实的 DNS 解析，GFW 的 DNS 污染攻击直接无效。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"远端解析"}],"：真实的 IP 解析发生在远端代理服务器（比如在日本或美国的机房），那里解析出来的 IP 一定是离目标最近、最准确的（比如 Google 的 CDN 节点）。"]}],"\n"]}]
